・スイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とりで</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">邦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>祖国；国家；日本</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くに</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">連邦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れんぽう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">联邦；邦联；联合体</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">素</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>基本；本质；素（未经加工）；裸露</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソ・ス</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">素</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">起源；源头；开端；基础；基底；根基；根本；原因；起因；（原）材料；原料；配料；底料（如蛋糕用）；高汤；己方；自己一边；本金；本钱；成本价；（植物的）根；（树的）主干；（笔、筷子等的）握持部分；柄部；和歌的前三句；（植物或树木的计数单位）株；棵；（鹰猎中鹰的计数单位）只</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">酸素</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんそ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">氧；氧气</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">要素</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようそ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">成分；因素；要素；项目；元素；成员</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">遣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>派遣；赠送；使用；做（动作）；给予</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つか.う・-つか.い・-づか.い・つか.わす・や.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">小遣い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こづかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">零花钱；零用钱；零花</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仮名遣い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かなづかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">假名用法；假名拼写规则</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">言葉遣い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ことばづかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">说话方式；措辞；语言运用</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">抗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>抵抗；反抗；违抗；对抗</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あらが.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">抵抗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抵抗；反抗；对抗；厌恶；反感；排斥；阻力；摩擦力；电阻；电阻器</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">反抗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">反抗；抵抗；抗拒；违抗；敌对；叛逆</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">抗議</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抗议；反对</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">模</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>模仿；复制；仿造</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">モ・ボ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">模様</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">图案；花纹；设计；状态；情况；状况；推测；现状判断；似乎的样子；模式；样本；例子；似乎要……；可能会……；（围棋）模样；大模样；势力范围</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">規模</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きぼ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">规模；范围；计划；结构</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">模型</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">模型；假人；雕塑模型</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">雄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>男性；雄性；英雄；杰出；优势</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お-・おす・おん</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雄性；公（动物、植物）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">英雄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えいゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">英雄；英雌；伟人；英雄交响曲（贝多芬，1804年）；英雄波兰舞曲（肖邦）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">益</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>利益；收益；利润；好处；增益</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エキ・ヤク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ま.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">利益</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りえき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">利润；收益；好处；利益；优势；权益；（神佛赐予的）恩惠；福佑；灵验</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">収益</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうえき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">收益；所得；回报；收入</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">有益</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうえき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">有益的；有利的；有用的；有帮助的；有启发意义的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">緊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>紧；紧张；紧急；牢固；严密</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">し.める・し.まる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">緊張</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">紧张；紧绷；神经紧张；压力；（国家、团体等之间的）紧张关系；对立；张力；肌张力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">緊急</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">紧急；紧迫</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">標</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>标记；符号；商标；目标；证据</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しるべ・しるし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">目標</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もくひょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">目标；目的地；标记；标志；地标</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">標識</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひょうしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">标志；标记；标识；信标；（语言学）标记；标记成分</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">標準</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひょうじゅん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">标准；准则；规范；典范；标记；平均；常态；普通</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>宣告；说；宣布</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span